Provide the tl-parser headers the release tarball is missing
generate.c includes tl-parser/tl-tl.h for the TL schema magic numbers and
mtproto-utils.c includes tl-parser/portable_endian.h for the endian helpers.
Both headers live in the tl-parser git submodule, but the tarball only carries
an empty tl-parser/ directory (Debian gets the same files from libtl-parser-dev,
which ships them under /usr/include/tl-parser).
The two files below are copied verbatim from the pinned tl-parser revision
1933e76f8f4fb74311be723b432e4c56e3a5ec06 - the revision the tl-parser package
this recipe depends on was built from.  tl-tl.h is GPL-2.0-or-later (with the
OpenSSL linking exemption), portable_endian.h is public domain; both are used at
build time only and are not installed into the package.
